 "details": "Handmade Love is a design and handmade market in the three halls of the southern Zirkelbau of Schwetzingen Palace, the former summer residence of the Palatine electors. Almost 100 makers sell one-off pieces: jewellery, fashion, home decor, bags, soaps, paper goods, candles and specialty food. There is food and crafting for children.\n\nSaturday and Sunday 11-18, last entry 17:00. Ticket 8 EUR (6-15 years 3 EUR), entry to the palace garden included, so it combines well with a walk in the park. Dogs only in the garden, on a leash.",
